    "Area": "All constructor/getter/Deserialize implementation bytes unchanged; same finite/negative admission, valid zero and signed-zero behavior.",
    "DirectionError": "Portable Zero/Infinite/NaN cause with the actual pinned Bevy Display strings. Its Serialize trait calls serializer.serialize_str with zero/infinite/nan, preserving original string representation even in binary serializers. GeometryError retains its original variant order/fields/messages; Clone/Eq are now derived from the portable cause."
  },
